---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Careers" description="Careers at Abunaw & Associates: pupils, associates, lateral hires and business services in Douala and Buea.">
<div>
  <section style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,104px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px) clamp(40px,5vw,64px)">
    <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#007EA7;margin-bottom:28px">Careers</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;max-width:22ch">Practise in two traditions</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#38484f;max-width:66ch;margin:32px 0 0">Our lawyers handle OHADA commercial work and common-law advocacy in the same week, in English and French. It is demanding training, and it is the reason clients instruct us.</p>
  </section>
  <hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.14);margin:0" />
  <section style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(40px,5vw,72px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px)">
    <div class="grid-4" style="display:grid;gap:clamp(28px,3vw,44px)">
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Pupils and trainees</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Structured rotation through corporate, land and disputes, with drafting supervised by a partner from the first month.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Associates</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Small teams, named responsibility on matters, and direct client contact earlier than a larger firm would allow.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Lateral hires</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">We are interested in lawyers with OHADA transactional depth, land expertise in the Anglophone regions, or litigation experience in the Southwest.</p></div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.2);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:0 0 10px">Business services</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a5a61">Roles in knowledge management, finance and client operations in Douala and Buea.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section data-reveal="1" style="max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,56px) clamp(20px,5vw,80px) clamp(56px,7vw,96px)">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px">
      <div style="grid-column:span 4;min-width:220px"><h2 style="font-family:Spectral,Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,32px);margin:0;max-width:14ch">Current openings</h2></div>
      <div style="grid-column:span 7;min-width:280px">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.16);padding:18px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#6b7b82">[Position title]</div><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6b7b82">[office] · [closing date]</div></div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.16);padding:18px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#6b7b82">[Position title]</div><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6b7b82">[office] · [closing date]</div></div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.16);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,23,31,0.16);padding:18px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#6b7b82">[Position title]</div><div style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6b7b82">[office] · [closing date]</div></div>
        <p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#28383f;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:66ch">Applications may be made in English or French. Send a curriculum vitae and a short covering letter to <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#6b7b82">[recruitment email]</span>, stating the office and practice that interest you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Base>
